{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月13日，據CNBC報道，就在黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)辭去英偉達CEO幾個小時後，美國總統特朗普接受了採訪，對黃仁勳遭遇的「可怕事情」表示惋惜。黃仁勳是特朗普在美國企業界的親密盟友。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586238.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.326094+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:50:50.857338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:50:50.857338+00:00","content_hash":"85e557f91af4cff45b601516de4fbba76393431088b45fba5feb08e8ca096959","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}